Additions in this fork
----------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Abdul Rauf, also under the MIT License:

  - web portal additions: the Insights, Profile, Documents, Compare, Interview
    and Offer pages; cover-letter, application-email, outreach, add-to-CV,
    outcome-recording and tracker-maintenance flows; and the associated
    /api routes and libraries
  - scanner/ — a GitHub Actions daily scan with a zero-dependency SMTP email
    digest
  - make-sandbox.mjs — a fixture-backed sandbox harness for verifying changes
    against a fictional persona instead of real career data

Where the fork's additions orchestrate upstream modes, they run those modes
rather than reimplementing them, so their behaviour remains the upstream
project's.

Full commit history, including every upstream commit and its original author,
is preserved in this repository's git history.

